      "writtenOn": "2026-06-02T20:54:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure about this. Are we consistently using `printk` or `CPRINTF` in the code?\n\nAny code that is common with `ec-legacy` (such as `fpsensor.cc`) will probably need to use `CPRINTF`, since we won\u0027t have `printk` there. However, this is test code under Zephyr, so it won\u0027t be used by the `eg-legacy` code.",
      "parentUuid": "1e1d56db_01f1e226",
