      "side": 1,
      "message": "I did a quick search for `platform/ec/zephyr/test CPRINTF`. I can mainly see `ccprintf`\n\nhttps://source.chromium.org/search?q\u003dplatform%2Fec%2Fzephyr%2Ftest%20CPRINTF\u0026ss\u003dchromiumos%2Fchromiumos%2Fcodesearch\n\nI can also see `printk`:\n\nhttps://source.chromium.org/search?q\u003dplatform%2Fec%2Fzephyr%2Ftest%20printk\u0026sq\u003d\u0026ss\u003dchromiumos%2Fchromiumos%2Fcodesearch\n\nthis is a zephyr-only test and will not be copied to `ec-legacy`\n\nI do not believe I can use the `LOG_INF` because this is a header file.",
